#由芽
Yume on Phone "Shinya? I'm on my way home, so just wait a little more."[p][r]
Shinya "You okay if I don't go to pick you up?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume on Phone "I'll be fine. I got some groceries for dinner too... Let's make it together."[p][r]
Shinya "Sure. I'll be waiting."[p][r]

(I can't believe that instead of breaking into her room, I'm going inside with the spare key that she's given me...)[p][r]
(She really does trust and love me wholeheartedly.)[p][r]

I ended the call and stood up.[p][r]

[_tb_end_text]

[bg  time="3000"  method="crossfade"  storage="room_Living_yoru.png"  ]
[playbgm  volume="35"  time="1000"  loop="true"  storage="love.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
I removed the camera I placed in her room when she first moved in.[p][r]

(I could look into whether she's cheating on me but... there's no need.)[p][r]
(No underhanded tricks. I'm going to accept Yume's feelings in earnest and believe in her.)[p][r]

I grabbed all the cameras that had been watching Yume in this room the entire time and tossed them into my bag.[p][r]
[playse storage="bell.mp3"]At that very moment, the doorbell rang.[p][r]

Shinya "I'll be right there!"[p][r]
[_tb_end_text]

[bg  time="3000"  method="crossfade"  storage="back_mansyonrouka_yoru.jpg"  ]
[chara_show  name="chara_yume"  time="1000"  wait="true"  storage="chara/121/adv_yume_def.gif"  width="1011"  height="1011"  left="142"  top="-1"  reflect="false"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
I opened the door to see Yume who stood before me, with her mask off and a huge smile on her face.[p][r]
Given her increasing popularity, she couldn't go on her daily commute without a mask to disguise her.[p][r]

#由芽
Yume "Oh? Isn't this Ms. Hiiragi Yume's room? Why is a man coming out?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Is Ms. Hiiragi Yume actually deep in a relationship? Are you Ms. Yume's lover?"[p][r]
Shinya "Why yes, I am. Welcome back Yume."[p][r]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_egao.gif"][r]
#由芽
Yume "Fufu, I'm back. I'm so glad to have you welcome me back that I got carried away."[p][r]

She closed the door and showed me the contents of her eco bag filled to bursting.[p][r]
[_tb_end_text]

[mask  time="1000"  effect="fadeIn"  color="0x000000"  ]
[bg  time="0"  method="crossfade"  storage="room_Living_yoru.png"  ]
[mask_off  time="3000"  effect="fadeOut"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#由芽
Yume "I got lots of stuff. Let's make some grilled fish and seasoned rice with toppings."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "My mom used to make it all the time for me. It tastes amazing."[p][r]
Shinya "I'm looking forward to it. And I'll help with anything I can do."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Sure. It's pretty simple to make. Let's get the prep work done then I'll take a bath."[p][r]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_tere.gif"][r]
#由芽
Yume "I wanna go in with you... Is that okay?"[p][r]
Shinya "Of course. Once we finish, we can relax a little and the rice will be ready by then."[p][r]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_egao.gif"][r]
#由芽
Yume "Oh right. I was just thinking on the way back home."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "It's rare that we get to spend the night together like this. I want to make the most of it and take our time in bed... if you get what I mean."[p][r]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_suki.gif"][r]
#由芽
Yume "Oh, but maybe you're getting tired of me always thinking about that stuff...?"[p][r]
Shinya "No, I'm happy that you're the one asking for it. I think it's really adorable of you."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Yay! I love you, Shinya..."[p][r]

Yume leaped into an embrace, which I returned.[p][r]

(Romance with a popular news anchor -- the me from half a year ago would never have believed it.)[p][r]

#由芽
Yume "Your smell really puts me at ease, Shinya... I wanna stay just like this."[p][r]
Shinya "Staying this close is bad for me... I'm liable to just push you down here and now."[p][r]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_egao.gif"][r]
#由芽
Yume "Eh? I'd like that too, but curb your desires a little. I just need to get the food ready."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "But in exchange, why don't we pretend we're newlyweds? We can flirt while cooking dinner."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Oh, but playing around while I'm using the stove or the knife is off limits, okay?"[p][r]
Shinya "Haha, I know. Well, why don't we get started on dinner, honey?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Yeah. I wonder when the day will come that I'll be your bride for real and we can make dinner like this?"[p][r]
Shinya "I'd be more than happy to any day... But what about you, Yume?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Hmm, I guess I have to find the right timing and discuss it with the office."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "I'm still just an employee though. If I said I wanted to get married, I doubt they'd say no."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "But this is my first proper relationship and all. Maybe I'm getting ahead of myself?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "I should calm down first and think things through more thoroughly..."[p][r]
Shinya "Only if you're okay with it but... do you want to get married? If you're okay with someone like me."[p][r]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_suki.gif"][r]
#由芽
Yume "Really? Fufu, I'd like that."[p][r]

(Yume is actually going to become my bride for real...? Unbelievable.)[p][r]
(I can't help but think this is all some weird delusion.)[p][r]

#由芽
Yume "You were zoning out there. What's on your mind?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Oh, was all that talk about marriage too heavy, or too much trouble for you?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "I-I didn't mean to try and rush us into a marriage or anything. I was just thinking it'd be nice if we could someday..."[p][r]
Shinya "I'd be okay with it anytime. So you can just tell me when the time is right for you, Yume."[p][r]
Shinya "But in exchange, let me be the one to propose."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "I'd love that... It's a promise!"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "This is great. And before that, I hope you can come stay at my family's inn too."[p][r]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_egao.gif"][r]
#由芽
Yume "I want you to see the place where I grew up. I want to show you all the things that I love."[p][r]

(Up 'til now, I thought I knew everything about Yume from all the secret footage of her.)[p][r]
(But I guess I could learn so much from Yume herself too.)[p][r]
(Guess I really don't need the cameras anymore.)[p][r]

Yume didn't know anything about how I'd secretly recorded her, or how I snuck into her room.[p][r]
And I wouldn't reveal it to her even if the two of us spent the rest of our lives together.[p][r]
If I deleted all the footage off my PC, there'd be no trace left.[p][r]

(But is it really okay? That she'd never get to know the truth behind me...?)[p][r]

#由芽
Yume "I'll finish setting up. Just a minute."[p][r]

[_tb_end_text]

[chara_hide  name="chara_yume"  time="1000"  wait="true"  pos_mode="false"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#由芽
Yume "Hmm, hm hmm~♪"[p][r]
Shinya "Umm, Yume..."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Hmm? What is it? You must be hungry right? I'm just about done."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "And if you're really starving, maybe we can have a quick drink before we head into the bath?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "I got some great snacks to go with drinks too~"[p][r]
Shinya "Yeah... I am feeling a little peckish. Maybe I'll have some."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Fufu, I knew it! I was feeling a bit hungry too. We can both have some."[p][r]

(Guess I don't need to tell her about spying on her... No point in scaring her like that.)[p][r]
(I'm taking that secret with me to the grave. I'll just never take secret recordings ever again.)[p][r]
(Instead, I'll pour everything I've got into treasuring Yume.)[p][r]

Shinya "Yume, I wanna kiss."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Eh? What's up? You're pretty indulgent today, Shinya. Fufu, it's cute..."[p][r]

Yume hopped over and hugged me tightly.[p][r]
I returned her embrace and gave her a little peck.[p][r]

[_tb_end_text]

