[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#由芽
Yume "Nn... Fufu. Was that enough? Let's save the rest for later, okay?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "You can ask for anything you want. I'll take real good care of you, like a baby."[p][r]
Shinya "Well, can baby have some milkies from your boobies?"[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Geez Shinya, you're such a perv... But... okay."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "You sure love sucking on my boobs while I stroke your dick, don't you? We can lots of that later."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "I'll give you lots of head pats."[p][r]
Shinya "Yume, it's gonna react a certain way if you tell me that..."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "Fufu! Was that too much of a tease? I'm looking forward to our make out session."[p][r]
#由芽
Yume "C'mon, let's get dinner prepped already. And the bath should be almost ready too."[p][r]
Shinya "Enough messing around then!"[p][r]

Yume took the apron draped on the chair and got back into position in the kitchen.[p][r]
I gazed at Yume enjoying herself, and savored this happiness.[p][r]

#由芽
Yume "I love you, Shinya."[p][r]

