#由芽
Yume "The results came back positive... Just thinking about how your baby might be inside me makes me so happy."[p]
Shinya "Yume...!"[p]

Without thinking, I embraced Yume.[p]

Shinya "We can't just stand around here! We need to prepare for the wedding!"[p]
#由芽
Yume "W-Wait! I haven't been to the hospital yet so I'm not absolutely sure of the pregnancy just yet."[p]
#由芽
Yume "But... I'm glad to see you felt happy about it. Fufu!"[p]
Shinya "Of course I would be. You're going to be such a lovely mother."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Yeah... You're going to be a daddy too. Looking forward to it."[p]
Shinya "Yeah, likewise. I'm counting on you."[p]
Shinya "I'll treasure you my whole life."[p]
